---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="美区 Apple ID 共享与注册全指南 - 2026 iOS Shadowrocket 下载指引"
  description="详细讲解美区 Apple ID 获取方式、在 App Store 正确登录下载小火箭 (Shadowrocket) 的安全规避指引与自注册教程。"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="w-full max-w-[1920px] mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 min-h-screen bg-slate-50/50">
    
    <!-- 面包屑 -->
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium px-1 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">首页</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">美区 Apple ID 共享与指南</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- 响应式布局: 中间主区 + 右侧侧栏 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
      
      <!-- 主内容区 -->
      <section class="flex-1 min-w-0 w-full space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Header Banner -->
        <div class="relative w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50/90 via-indigo-50/60 to-slate-50 border border-blue-200/80 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-slate-800 shadow-xs">
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2">美区 Apple ID 使用与注册指南</h1>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-medium">下载 Shadowrocket（小火箭）、Quantumult X 等 iOS 梯子客户端的必看说明</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 严重警告 -->
        <div class="bg-red-50/90 border-2 border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-red-900 space-y-3 shadow-2xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-black text-red-700">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>安全防锁警告 (使用共享账号必须遵守)</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold space-y-1.5 pl-2">
            <li>❌ <strong>严禁在手机【设置】或【iCloud】中登录共享账号</strong> (会导致个人手机被锁定)</li>
            <li>❌ <strong>仅限在 App Store 商店内部切换登录</strong>，下载完成后立即退出</li>
            <li>❌ <strong>绝对不要开启双重认证或绑定个人手机号</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 正确使用步骤 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-6 bg-blue-600 rounded-full inline-block"></span>
            <span>App Store 正确登录指引 (5 步法)</span>
          </h2>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-600">STEP 01</div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">打开桌面 App Store</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">在 iPhone / iPad 找到 App Store 图标点击进入。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-600">STEP 02</div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">退出个人原账号</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">点击右上角头像，拉到最底部点击“退出登录”。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-600">STEP 03</div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">仅在 App Store 登录美区 ID</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">输入美区账号密码，如弹 iCloud 合并提示，选择“不合并”。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-blue-600">STEP 04</div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">搜索 Shadowrocket 并下载</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">搜索 Shadowrocket 并点击下载，等待图标下载安装完成。</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 text-center">
            <a href="/blog/ios-shadowrocket-guide/" class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl shadow-2xs transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer no-underline" style="color: #ffffff !important;">
              <span style="color: #ffffff !important;">阅读完整 iOS 小火箭配置教程</span>
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 自建美区 ID 指引 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-6 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full inline-block"></span>
            <span>强烈建议：注册一个属于自己的美区 ID</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            共享账号容易因为多人异地登录被苹果安全锁定。自建美区 ID 仅需 5 分钟，无需信用卡（付款方式选 None 即可），终身稳定属于自己。
          </p>

          <div class="bg-blue-50/70 p-4 rounded-xl border border-blue-200/80 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 space-y-2">
            <div class="font-extrabold text-blue-900">自注册简要步骤：</div>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-700">
              <li>使用电脑或手机浏览器打开 <code class="bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-blue-200">appleid.apple.com</code></li>
              <li>点击右上角“创建您的 Apple ID”，国家与地区务必选择<strong>美国 (United States)</strong></li>
              <li>填写邮箱并完成验证码校验</li>
              <li>登录 App Store，首次下载时选择“无 (None)”付款方式，免税州地址填选阿拉斯加或俄勒冈州地址</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- 右侧侧栏 (Sticky top-20) -->
      <aside class="w-full lg:w-[280px] xl:w-[320px] 2xl:w-[340px] shrink-0 space-y-6 sticky top-20">
        
        <!-- 站长 Profile -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-5 shadow-xs relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold shadow-xs">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-sm">站长 / 测评官</h4>
              <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-[11px] rounded font-bold border border-blue-200">5年探针实测</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-3">基于分布式探针全天候对专线连通率与晚高峰吞吐进行实测复核。</p>
          <a href="http://liangxinyun.club/" target="_blank" class="w-full py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs text-center font-bold rounded-xl transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 shadow-2xs" style="color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none !important;">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm4.64 6.8c-.15 1.58-.8 5.42-1.13 7.19-.14.75-.42 1-.68 1.03-.58.05-1.02-.38-1.58-.75-.88-.58-1.38-.94-2.23-1.5-.99-.65-.35-1.01.22-1.59.15-.15 2.71-2.48 2.76-2.69.01-.03.01-.14-.07-.2-.08-.06-.19-.04-.27-.02-.12.02-1.96 1.25-5.54 3.67-.52.36-1 .54-1.43.53-.47-.01-1.37-.27-2.04-.49-.82-.27-1.47-.42-1.42-.88.03-.24.37-.49 1.02-.75 3.99-1.74 6.66-2.89 8.01-3.46 3.82-1.61 4.61-1.89 5.13-1.9.11 0 .37.03.54.17.14.12.18.28.2.45-.01.07.01.21 0 .26z"/></svg>
            <span style="color: #ffffff !important;">Telegram 频道</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- 客户端快捷跳转 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-5 shadow-xs">
          <h4 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-base mb-3 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
              客户端快速下载
            </span>
          </h4>
          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold">
            <a href="/downloads/" class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:text-blue-600 rounded-xl transition-all border border-slate-100 text-slate-800">
              <span>全平台客户端下载</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">查看 →</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/blog/ios-shadowrocket-guide/" class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:text-blue-600 rounded-xl transition-all border border-slate-100 text-slate-800">
              <span>Shadowrocket 小火箭教程</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">查看 →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
